		<summary>Your team of AI agents, texting-style, on your phone</summary>
		<desc>YakkBot is a team of AI agents you text like friends. Each Bot has its own
soul and memory, its own computer you can watch and take over, skills it
learns as it works, and it can use your phone, email and GitHub with your OK.

Everything can run free and on the phone: AI models downloaded to the device
(GGUF), a built-in Linux computer, and the phone's own voice.</desc>
